367 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 368 0 R/Alt(Four line drawings of the article's mode shapes, free on its lab suspension. Each shows the undeformed frame as a gray dotted line, the deformed chassis in solid blue and the deformed component tubes in thick dashed orange. Mode 7 at 74 Hz, a component mode with 62 percent of its energy in the components: two of the top components swing while the chassis barely moves. Mode 14 at 117 Hz, a chassis mode with 8 percent in the components: the top frame twists and the posts lean. Mode 16 at 159 Hz, a chassis mode with 4 percent in the components: the frame bends and twists more strongly. Mode 30 at 408 Hz, a component mode with 68 percent in the components: one component moves while the chassis is nearly still.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 898 0 R>>
endobj
