398 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 399 0 R/Alt(Four panels of acceleration spectra from 20 Hz to 2 kHz, in decibels relative to the target peak. Top row, 6 shakers and 12 controls; bottom row, 12 shakers and the same 12 controls. Left column, control gauge 25Z; right column, held-out gauge 17X. Each panel shows the target as a thin black solid line and the achieved response as a thin blue dashed line, line by line, with the one-third-octave band values as open black circles (target) and orange filled triangles (achieved). Top left: the achieved response follows the target closely, with band errors of 2.7 dB RMS. Bottom left: target and achieved lie on top of each other. Top right: the held-out gauge is off in both directions, 8.4 dB RMS. Bottom right: the held-out gauge runs well above its target between about 150 and 300 Hz, by up to 19 dB in a band.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 899 0 R>>
endobj
